{"id":"664666","name":"虾饼","author":"阳台上的草莓","authorId":"7597089","desc":"","cover":"images/664666/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"虾仁","amount":"10个"}],"sub":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1个"},{"name":"淀粉","amount":"3匙"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"虾仁加鸡蛋用料理机打成泥。","img":"images/664666/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放入玉米粒，胡萝卜碎（提前用开水焯1分钟）搅拌均匀。","img":"images/664666/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入淀粉搅拌均匀。","img":"images/664666/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"平底锅放油烧热，取虾泥摊成小饼。","img":"images/664666/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"煎2面金黄即可。","img":"images/664666/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/664666/step_6.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}